   "type": "code",
   "data": {
    "filename": "vg_2.py",
    "headingEn": "validate and verify",
    "headingKn": "validate ಮತ್ತು verify",
    "descEn": "validate checks required keys, requires the exit code to be exactly an int (type(v) is int), and checks task id and revision. verify reports every invalid record as a finding, matches the required command among the valid ones and lets the last matching record decide.",
    "descKn": "validate ಅಗತ್ಯ ಕೀಲಿಗಳನ್ನು ಪರಿಶೀಲಿಸಿ, exit code ನಿಖರವಾಗಿ int (type(v) is int) ಆಗಿರಬೇಕು ಎಂದು ಬಯಸಿ, task id ಮತ್ತು revision ಪರಿಶೀಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ. verify ಪ್ರತಿ ಅಮಾನ್ಯ ದಾಖಲೆಯನ್ನು finding ಆಗಿ ವರದಿ ಮಾಡಿ, ಮಾನ್ಯವಾದವುಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಅಗತ್ಯ ಆದೇಶ ಹೊಂದಿಸಿ ಕೊನೆಯ ಹೊಂದುವ ದಾಖಲೆ ನಿರ್ಧರಿಸುವಂತೆ ಮಾಡುತ್ತದೆ.",
    "code": "def valid_exit(v):\n    return type(v) is int\n\n\ndef validate(rec, task_id, revision):\n    errs = []\n    if not isinstance(rec, dict):\n        return [\"record is not an object\"]\n    for k in (\"command\", \"exit_code\", \"task_id\", \"revision\"):\n        if k not in rec:\n            errs.append(f\"missing {k}\")\n    if errs:\n        return errs\n    if not isinstance(rec[\"command\"], str):\n        errs.append(\"command must be a string\")\n    if not valid_exit(rec[\"exit_code\"]):\n        errs.append(f\"exit_code must be an int, got {type(rec['exit_code']).__name__}\")\n    if rec[\"task_id\"] != task_id:\n        errs.append(\"record belongs to another task\")\n    if rec[\"revision\"] != revision:\n        errs.append(\"record is for another revision\")\n    return errs\n\n\ndef verify(records, task_id, revision, normalise=False):\n    findings, valid = [], []\n    for i, r in enumerate(records):\n        e = validate(r, task_id, revision)\n        if e:\n            findings.append((\"EVIDENCE_INVALID\", i, e[0]))\n        else:\n            valid.append(r)\n    key = (lambda s: \" \".join(s.split())) if normalise else (lambda s: s)\n    m = [r for r in valid if key(r[\"command\"]) == key(CMD)]\n    if not m:\n        findings.append((\"ACCEPTANCE_NOT_RUN\", None, CMD))\n    elif m[-1][\"exit_code\"] != 0:\n        findings.append((\"ACCEPTANCE_FAILED\", None, str(m[-1][\"exit_code\"])))\n    return not findings, findings"
   }
